# First RUN file for this ground. Ribbingsfors' 2026-09-04 generation was compiled with the generic
# tools run locally -- the runbook prints the exact commands -- over the reviewed 2,048 m window, and
# it was never on a RUN file only because nobody pushed one. The standard ring graph now carries 1 m
