# measured trees stand on 64 of the 256 finest tiles and the surrounding 192 carry none.
#
# The widened window EARNS A SOURCE ITEM: level zero spans E 446928-451024, crossing E 450000, so
# 23b028-653_45 owns published finest tiles for the first time. The 2026-09-04 compile passed one
# --raster because 653_45 owned none in the 2,048 m window; this run derives its raster arguments
# from what build-canopy actually wrote, so it will pass two.
#
# This ground registers no copc-hierarchy-census artifact, so the census step writes a new
# unregistered evidence file that the run commits and the re-pin step is a documented no-op.
